  <refbody>
    <section id="about-this-page">
      <title>About this page</title>
      <p>uFTi is made with parts that other people wrote. This page names the parts that are in uFTi for Windows. It gives the version and the licence of each. A licence says what you may do with a part.</p>
      <p>The list is made from the build of uFTi that this manual describes.</p>
    </section>
